      "outputs": ["insights", "proposals", "receipt"],
      "hosting": "hosted-or-docker",
      "handoff": "既有對話可嵌入；連接 Pol.is 帳號的 Site ID 後可第一次載入自動建立。完整自架需要 Docker 與 PostgreSQL。"
    },
    {
      "id": "talk-to-the-city",
